# The Trilium server release that awm serves (install.md R115 item 4): a tarball that a
# release of our fork (projects/trilium on mizar) published. Bump all three together,
# then deploy awm. Empty url keeps install.sh on its older paths.
# The tarball holds one top-level folder with main.cjs and node/bin/node, as upstream's
# server tarball does. install.sh refuses one whose sha256 differs.
version=
url=
sha256=
